<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 6.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 6.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     June 06     June 05   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  275.560     275.000     247.020   11.55 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.830     310.220     306.830    0.98 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.785     159.170     158.970   -0.12 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.072	47.164	47.182   -0.23 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  448.280     448.640     419.180    6.94 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.250     141.420     141.685   -0.31 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.166	16.183	16.185   -0.12 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  238.120     237.600     212.430   12.09 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.881	 1.884	 1.888   -0.37 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.575	 1.574	 1.581   -0.38 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.160     190.330     183.135    3.29 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
